Suppose `U = U_4 + U_bad` with `U_4` supported on `4Z` and `ord_eta U_bad = M_2+m`.
Then `(1+U)^{-n/m} = (1+U_4)^{-n/m} * (1 + U_bad/(1+U_4))^{-n/m}`, whose first
