H_1=54y^2-36y+5,
c=-4y(9y-1)/81.
```

After four checked affine pivots the normalized system contains the
coefficient-field constant

```text
20y-10/3, inverse 27/10-27y/5 modulo H_1.
```

Thus its ideal is `[1]` before any multivariate basis computation. The
