+```text
+2, 3, 6, q, q^2, q^3, t, e, t+1, 3t+2, 4t+1,
+m+1 (0<=m<t), 2m+1 (0<=m<=2t),
+4t-2j+1 in the ranges of (2.10),(2.11), F_C, F_Q.    (3.6)
