+The exact/finite degree sequences are
+
+```text
+deg T_(t,k)=4t+1-k, k=0,...,2t-1, for t=2,...,6,
+deg_y(coefficient)<=1,
+```
+
+where the equality is a finite control and (2.14)--(2.15), not equality, is
+the uniform theorem.
+
+At the first split index,
