+rank-two algebra was inverted.
+
+At the next split index `t=11`, `d=+2,-2`, equivalently
+`y=7/23,5/23`.  Modulo `1009` these are `y=439,746`.  Five deterministic
+points on each factor passed the full coefficient recurrence, every high
+diagonal, and all 22 terminal evaluations.  This is a formula/split-safety
