+Every term on the last two lines is nonnegative for `t>=2,n>=1`, and the
+constant part is positive.  For `n=q-j>=1`,
+
+```text
+3B_Q^2-A_Q^2(t+1)=-(t+1)(3t+2)^2 F_Q(t,q-n),
+F_Q(t,q-n)=n^2+4nt+6n+4t^2-3 >= 12.                 (3.5)
+```
