+```text
+3B_C^2-A_C^2(t+1)=-(3t+2)^3 F_C(t,t-n),
+F_C(t,t-n)=
+ 3n^4+24n^3t+42n^3+66n^2t^2+146n^2t+119n^2
+ +72nt^3+238nt^2+234nt+104n
+ +27t^4+134t^3+223t^2+136t+32.                     (3.4)
+```
