+## 5. `TOP-TAIL-UNIT`
+
+Set `b4=1`.  Vanishing of bands `t,...,2t-1`, after the high recursion, says
+that `deg_X E_t<t`.  The requested universal conclusion is still
+
+```text
+OPEN[TOP-TAIL-UNIT]:
+ <T_(t,t),...,T_(t,2t-1)>=[1]
+ in A_t[b3,u_2,...,u_(t-1)] for every t>=2.           (5.1)
+```
