+## 4. Controls for the recurrence
+
+The new Singular driver performs (2.1)--(2.13) directly and checks every
+affine pivot row before substitution.  Its exact output agrees, with the sign
+(1.3), with every terminal coefficient in the banked JSON at `t=2,3,4,5`.
