+### 5.2 Why the proposed affine triangle is not yet present
+
+In the residual auxiliaries the top rows are nonlinear: for `t=3,4,5` their
+total degrees range respectively through `4--5`, `5--6`, and `6--8`.  Modular
+subsystem audits on one `H_t` fibre give the following zero-dimensional lengths
