+# The terminal family on the normalized K=16 ray
+
+**Lane:** `k16-terminal-proof-sol56-20260903`  
+**Date:** 2026-09-03  
+**Verdict:** **PARTIAL.**  A closed, coefficientwise, symbolic-`t` recurrence
