+For `k=0`, the same rule holds for the nonconstant part and the extra term is
+`-c`.  Hence, with `W=4t+1-k`,
+
+```text
+deg_b4 <= W,
+deg_b3 <= floor(W/(t+1)),
+deg_(u_i) <= floor(W/i),
+total degree <= W.                                   (2.15)
+```
