+The elementary inverses used in (2.3)--(2.12) are
+
+```text
+y^(-1)=6q((t+1)-d)/((t+1)(3t+2)),
+g^(-1)=6q^3(2(t+1)-3d)/(t(t+1)e(4t+1)),
+p_(2t+1)^(-1)=6q^2(3qd-(t+1))/(t(t+1)e(4t+1)).       (3.3)
+```
