+## 6. `RESIDUAL-ZERO`
+
+At `b4=0`, (2.14) proves every positive-band row vanishes at the residual
+origin.
+
+### 6.1 A uniform `b3`-axis calculation
+
+Set all `u_2,...,u_(t-1)` to zero as well.  The weight induction (2.8)--(2.9)
+then leaves exactly
