+### 6.1 A uniform `b3`-axis calculation
+
+Set all `u_2,...,u_(t-1)` to zero as well.  The weight induction (2.8)--(2.9)
+then leaves exactly
+
+```text
+C=X^(t-1),
+U=X^(2t+1)+a b3 X^t,       b2=0,
+a=-(6dt-3d+9t^2+2t-1)/(6t(3t-1)).                  (6.1)
+```
