+| `t` | variables | degree vectors by band |
+|---:|---|---|
+| 3 | `(b3,u2)` | `(2,5),(2,4),(2,4)` |
+| 4 | `(b3,u2,u3)` | `(2,6,4),(2,6,4),(2,5,3),(2,5,3)` |
+| 5 | `(b3,u2,u3,u4)` | `(2,8,5,4),(2,7,5,3),(2,7,4,3),(2,6,4,3),(2,6,4,3)` |
