+| `t` | ascending bands | descending bands |
+|---:|---:|---:|
+| 3 | 10 | 8 |
+| 4 | 57 | 44 |
+| 5 | 298 | 224 |
+
+Removing any one top row at `t=3,4,5` also leaves a nonzero zero-dimensional
