+| 6 | `Q[y]/(H_6)` | 253 | `b3^5, u2^16, u3^11, u4^8, u5^7` |
+
+Each reduction was zero in the displayed characteristic-zero algebra.  Since
+all generators vanish at the origin and a power of every residual variable
