+|---|---|---|
+| `y` | `(t+1)(3t+2)` | none for `t>=2` |
+| `3d+2(t+1)` (the class of `g`) | `12q^2(t+1)(4t+1)` | none for `t>=2` |
+| `L_C` | `-4q^2(3t+2)^3 F_C(t,j)` | none for `t>=2, 1<=j<t` by (3.4) |
+| `L_Q` | `-4q^2(t+1)(3t+2)^2 F_Q(t,j)` | none for `t>=2, t<=j<=2t` by (3.5) |
