+### 5.3 Exact determinant reduction of the open step
+
+Put `F_r=T_(t,t+r)|_(b4=1)` for `0<=r<t`, choose
+`J_t=<F_0,...,F_(t-2)>`, and set
+`B_t=A_t[b3,u_2,...,u_(t-1)]/J_t`.  If `B_t` is first proved finite over
