+-4q^2(t-2)(3t-1)^2(3t+2)(27t^3+17t^2+t+2).          (3.6)
+```
+
+It is nonzero for every integer `t>=3`: every factor is then positive except
+the displayed leading minus sign.  Its sole admissible boundary zero is
