+```text
+OPEN[TOP-TAIL-UNIT]:
+ <T_(t,t),...,T_(t,2t-1)>=[1]
+ in A_t[b3,u_2,...,u_(t-1)] for every t>=2.           (5.1)
+```
+
+### 5.1 Exact advance at `t=5`
+
+The charged `t=5` JSON has SHA-256
+`f68a4666afb25490ceb62ec2b2f9ebe9b22b61c415cbf66edc074eb50a650689`,
