+```text
+lambda_2(t,d)=rho_(t+1),
+[X^(2t-1)]R=lambda_2(t,d) u_2^(t+1) on this axis.     (6.5)
+```
+
+All pre-pivot scalar denominators are safe: `t-2r>=1` in the beta range and
+`4t-4r+1>=1` where `f_r` can occur.  Writing the reduced output as
