+Let `I_t=<T_(t,0),...,T_(t,2t-1)>`.  If the `b4=0` chart is unit, then `b4`
+is invertible in the quotient by `I_t`, because `(I_t,b4)=[1]`.  If the
+dehomogenized `b4=1` chart is unit, choose a finite certificate
