679:for `t=1,2,3,4,5`.  `RESIDUAL-ZERO` also closes the `b4=0` half at `t=6`.
680:The exact `t=6` top-tail run is inconclusive as recorded in Section 5, so
681:(8.1) is not promoted at `t=6` here.
NO_TEMP_REPORT

